; Only read when pnpm runs with CWD here (e.g. `electron-forge start`), which is enough
; to satisfy Forge's dev-start config check. A workspace-root `pnpm install` does NOT read
; this file, so the real node_modules layout stays isolated. Before adding electron-forge
; make/package, move node-linker=hoisted to a workspace-root .npmrc (changes all packages'
; layout). Tracked in roadmap.md under Electron packaging.
node-linker=hoisted
